@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Record Manual Application and Preserve Submitted Materials
start
:Open authorized application;
:Identify actual submission context;
:Select exact revision / authored material / files as applicable;
:Review capture selection and confirm;
:Validate authority, request identity and material availability;
if (Capture confirmed?) then (yes)
 :Show immutable submission event and exact retained materials;
 :Later profile edits / withdrawal leave history intact;
 :Open submitted-material view through authorized history;
else (no / uncertain)
 :Show invalid, denied, unavailable or pending capture accurately;
 :Preserve required protection while outcome is uncertain;
 :Resolve recorded operation before duplicate capture;
endif
stop
@enduml
